 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Then, al, for, before",
   "texto": [
    "**После** (after) + genitive: **после окончания** (after completion). **При** (al, at the time of) + prepositional: **при входе** (when entering). **Во время** (during) + genitive: **во время урока** (during the class). **Перед** (before) + instrumental: **перед выходом** (before leaving)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "With conjugated verb",
   "texto": [
    "If there is a conjugated verb, **когда** is used (when): **Когда я вошёл, все встали** (when I entered, all were raised). **При входе** is very formal and is seen in posters: **При входе — билеты** (when entering, tickets)."
   ]
  },
